{'symbol': 'SYY', 'date': '2021-01-28 16:15:00', 'title': 'SYSCO PURCHASES MORE THAN 21,000 GIFT CARDS FROM RESTAURANT CUSTOMERS NATIONWIDE TO SUPPORT THE INDUSTRY AND THANK OPERATIONS FRONTLINE ASSOCIATES', 'text': "HOUSTON, JAN. 28, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- SYSCO CORPORATION (NYSE: SYY), THE LEADING GLOBAL FOODSERVICE DISTRIBUTION COMPANY, ANNOUNCED IT HAD PURCHASED MORE THAN 21,000 GIFT CARDS PROVIDING A CASH FLOW BOOST TOTALING MORE THAN $525,000 TO SUPPORT ITS RESTAURANT CUSTOMERS ACROSS THE UNITED STATES. EACH OF THESE $25 GIFT CARDS WERE GIVEN TO SYSCO'S OPERATIONS FRONTLINE ASSOCIATES IN APPRECIATION FOR THEIR HARD WORK AND DEDICATION TO THE COMPANY'S CUSTOMERS."}